          "kicker": "Match result",
          "heading": "Fiji beaten 54-17 in Lyon as France reclaim Northern Hemisphere lead",
          "body": "France ran in the points at Lyon on Saturday, and the 54-17 scoreline makes it Fiji's fourth defeat from four logged games. Fiji's squad included 11 players who play in France, a familiarity that did not stop the Bleus. The rout was also marred for France by an injury to Romain Ntamack. Fiji's next opponent, Ireland, beat Argentina by 30 points on Friday night."
        },
