      "edition": "Sunday 8 November",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Coaching backing",
          "heading": "Bill Sweeney backs Steve Borthwick to lead England at 2027 World Cup",
          "body": "The RFU's chief executive, Bill Sweeney, has given Steve Borthwick unequivocal backing to lead England at the 2027 World Cup before Sunday's Nations Championship clash with Australia at Twickenham. Sweeney said: \"We're committed to Steve. We believe in what he's doing.\" The RFU extended Borthwick's contract until after the 2028 Six Nations two months ago, although England have lost five of their last seven Tests. Sweeney also accepted a difficult Six Nations, but wants to see continued progress."
        },
        {
