          "kicker": "Hooker's hat-trick",
          "heading": "Ewan Ashman's first-half hat-trick cannot prevent Scotland's second-half collapse against All Blacks",
          "body": "Ewan Ashman's three first-half tries left Scotland only three points down at the break in a 43-21 defeat, but the second half belonged to New Zealand. Josh Moorby, Beauden Barrett and Asafo Aumua scored after the interval while Scotland failed to register a point. Gregor Townsend said the performance fell short of what supporters could be proud of: \"And it wasn't there today.\""
        },
