          "heading": "Steve Tandy admits Wales lacked ruthlessness in Japan win despite bonus point",
          "body": "Tandy said he could not run away from a below-par performance in which Wales looked flat at times and let Japan stay in the contest, and he put some of the clunkiness down to rust, given it was the first Test since July. Wales now face New Zealand next weekend, and Tandy said his side cannot afford cheap opportunities against the All Blacks. Wales have two wins from four in the Nations Championship."
