          "body": "Captain Julián Montoya went off for a head injury assessment 28 minutes into Friday's 42-12 defeat in Dublin and never returned to the field. Leonel Oviedo also went off for a head injury assessment on 36 minutes, returning four minutes later. The coverage reports no outcome for either assessment, and nothing on whether Montoya is available for next weekend's test against Italy."
