          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Fraser McReight earns 50th cap as Wallabies name Jeremy Williams at blindside",
          "body": "Australia's back row is reshaped for the Test against England at Allianz Stadium, Twickenham, with Harry Wilson again captaining from number eight. Jeremy Williams is named at blindside flanker, alongside Fraser McReight, who will earn his 50th cap for Australia. Len Ikitau returns in midfield after missing the last Test under HIA protocols, partnering Isaac Henry, who will play his first Test in the United Kingdom. Taniela Tupou is back among the replacements."
